  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women Protection Behind Bars</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will help women who are trapped in Yemini prisons without legal representation (currently over 50 women but the number is growing everyday) by providing legal support to these women by providing qualified field lawyers at no charge to represent them and argue their cases in front of courts and public prosecution, They will also provide the necessary legal advice, support, and follow up so these women are not left alone to  fight an unfair system or languish in prison.</narrative>
  </description>
